    "extract": "Anklets are a type of sock. They are not long, typically reaching just below or above the ankle. Anklets are sometimes folded or cuffed over. Ankle socks are usually worn with low-heeled shoes such as sneakers and are popular among both men and women.",
    "extract_html": "<p><b>Anklets</b> are a type of sock. They are not long, typically reaching just below or above the ankle. Anklets are sometimes folded or cuffed over. Ankle socks are usually worn with low-heeled shoes such as sneakers and are popular among both men and women.</p>"
